{
  "title": "Syrian Lamb Kebabs",
  "description": "Savory Syrian lamb kebabs featuring white wine, perfect for a midnight craving, these crumbly kebabs are egg-free-friendly and deliciously satisfying.",
  "cuisine": "Syrian",
  "diet": [
